# MWX-ISP — Ultra-Deep Repository Audit & 30 Issue-Ready Recommendations
**Tanggal audit:** 27 Oktober 2026  · **Repository:** https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp
**Laporan analisis saja** — tidak ada code changes, branch baru, maupun GitHub Issues yang dibuat dalam pekerjaan ini.

## 1. Executive Audit Summary
Baseline remote setelah PR #57/#58 merged: `main` = `dev` = `1b791f80eed0ead3d679dd890fed56a342d4c104`. Repo memiliki sekitar 1.105 tree entries (termasuk dictionary dan docs), latest published release saat audit adalah `v0.13.0`; issue #45–#54 semuanya **closed** dan **tidak disalin ulang**. CI pada dev `6903f316` sukses (dua run); run main baru setelah promosi masih **in progress** saat pemeriksaan. Maka laporan tidak mengklaim CI latest main sudah hijau ataupun fitur production-verified.
Repositori memiliki backend Go 1.26, Echo/GORM, RADIUS auth/accounting/RadSec/EAP, PostgreSQL/OpenLDAP integration, React Admin/Vite frontend, FUP, ISP billing, NOC impact, customer timeline, voucher lifecycle, backup manifest/encryption dan dual-language docs. Kekuatan: banyak tes integrasi dan rollback drills, tenant-scoped model callback, zero open issue pada titik inspeksi. Kelemahan: beberapa read paths masih expose data sensitif, sinyal ACK ingestion tidak selalu sesuai persistensi, silent drops syslog, N+1 DB, dan gap bukti E2E/clean VPS. Banyak temuan static-inferred memerlukan reproduksi sebelum disebut bug production.
## 2. Current State Assessment
| Domain | Status berdasar sumber | Batas klaim |
|---|---|---|
| RADIUS Auth/EAP/RadSec | Implemented + unit/integration EAP accepted | Bukan verifikasi seluruh NAS nyata; M10.5 anonim identity masih backlog |
| ISP billing/FUP/multi-tenant | Implemented, DB transaction & tenant tests | Concurrency edge + task scalability perlu simulasi |
| Vouchers/NOC/Customer 360 | Delivered dalam #49/#53/#54 dan code paths present | Quota byte masih eksplisit non-supported pada kontrak sebelumnya |
| Backup/restore | Schema 9.3 encrypted PG drill executed | Full-VPS restore / PITR tidak divalidasi |
| CI/release | dev 6903f316 CI+workflow lint success; main=dev | Run pada promotion commit in progress saat audit |
| Frontend UX | React Admin, bilingual resources, guided onboarding | Playwright configured, testDir web/e2e absent in latest Git tree |
| Security/ops | Tenant callback + authenticated access | NAS secret JSON exposure dan syslog attribution ambigu perlu segera ditangani |
## 3. Gap Analysis & 10 Critical Findings
**Prioritas keamanan:** (1) NAS secret API response, (2) ambiguous syslog source attribution, (3) HTTP monitor redirect to unapproved destinations. **Integritas transaksi:** (4) premature Accounting-Response on saturated pool, (5) billing event duplication possible under concurrent workers, (6) NAS IP check-then-insert race. **Reliability / correctness:** (7) syslog queue and DB errors silently dropped, (8) monitor target without samples shown as 100% uptime. **Operational proof:** (9) frontend Playwright test directory missing, (10) clean-host VPS install + full restore/PITR not demonstrated. See detailed issues below. Evidentiary meaning: findings 1,4,7,8 are verified code paths; the safety impact and production exploitability still require tests.
## 4. Scoring and Ranking
Each dimension 1–10: I=Impact, U=Urgency, A=Strategic Alignment, C=Confidence/Evidence, F=Feasibility; complexity K and regression risk R are penalty factors. **Priority Score (0–100) = clamp(round(3I + 2.5U + 1.5A + 1.5C + 1.5F − 1.2(K−1) − 0.8(R−1)), 0,100)**. Priority P0 is sorted before P1 then P2 (mandatory safety override); within a priority tier items sorted by score. Dependency order may modify the execution waves. Score is a prioritization heuristic, not a mathematical proof of severity.

