# [AUDIT-001][P0] Redact NAS shared secrets from list/detail/create/update API responses

> **Classification:** Security / Security & Data Protection  
> **Difficulty:** Easy · **Effort:** S · **Priority Score:** 96/100  
> **Evidence label:** Verified static · **Product scope:** Existing · **Feature contract:** TR-F009 / TR-F022 / TR-F033  
> **Baseline:** `bjo163/mwx-isp` `dev`/`main` SHA `1b791f80eed0ead3d679dd890fed56a342d4c104` (2026-10-27)

## Problem Statement
User yang berhak membaca daftar NAS berpotensi membaca shared secret RADIUS dan menggunakannya untuk menyalahgunakan perangkat/NAS.

## Evidence & Current State
`internal/domain/network.go:32` NetNas.Secret memakai json:"secret"; `internal/adminapi/nas.go:91-216` GET menggunakan DTO embedded NetNas; `:218-350` create/update mengembalikan NetNas, tanpa redaksi terlihat. GET tidak membutuhkan requireAdmin.

**Important:** Label Verified static berarti source sudah diperiksa, bukan exploit produksi telah diuji. Inferred memerlukan test reproduksi, sedangkan Proposed bukan klaim bug.

## Proposed Solution
Gunakan explicit safe NAS response DTO dan write-only secret field; jangan menampilkan secret pada log, export publik, maupun UI read response.

## Microtasks / Implementation Steps
- [ ] Tulis tes GET list/detail serta POST/PUT yang membuktikan secret tidak diekspos
- [ ] Implement safe DTO dan secret_configured boolean; admin tetap bisa set/rotate secret
- [ ] Ubah NAS form supaya secret kosong berarti tidak berubah pada update
- [ ] Audit serialisasi NetNas pada response API lain dan dokumentasi

## Files / Components Scope
- [`internal/adminapi/nas.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/adminapi/nas.go)
- [`internal/domain/network.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/domain/network.go)
- [`internal/adminapi/nas_test.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/adminapi/nas_test.go)
- [`web/src/resources/nas.tsx`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/web/src/resources/nas.tsx)

## Dependencies
Tidak ada hard dependency.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Tidak ada shared secret di JSON API response/read traces
- [ ] Admin dapat membuat/mengganti secret; operator read-only tidak memperolehnya
- [ ] Tes unauthorized, tenant overlap dan safe UI edit lulus
- [ ] Ada catatan kebutuhan rotasi secret yang sebelumnya mungkin terekspos

## Definition of Done
- [ ] Recheck latest `origin/dev` and existing closed issues; attach reproduction or design proof; no duplicate implementation.
- [ ] Relevant Go unit/integration tests with PostgreSQL where concurrency/constraints matter; frontend build/test where affected.
- [ ] Run `golangci-lint run`, `govulncheck` and actionlint when relevant; report executed results, never invent PASS.
- [ ] Verify authorization, tenant isolation, failure paths and backwards compatibility; attach benchmarks/migration notes where applicable.
- [ ] Update `docs/feature-checklist.md` FIRST if scope change is not yet authorized; update roadmap and EN/ID guidance when delivered.
- [ ] Link relevant commits/PR/CI; close only after acceptance is proven. Commits to existing `dev` only, promote reviewed to `main`; NEVER create another branch.

## Risks & Regression Impact
API consumers lama yang bergantung pada membaca secret akan berubah; perlakukan sebagai perbaikan keamanan breaking-response.

## Expected Impact
Mengurangi risiko pengambilalihan akses RADIUS/NAS.

## Prioritization Scores (1–10)
| Impact | Urgency | Alignment | Evidence/Confidence | Feasibility | Complexity | Risk | Weighted Score |
|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 10 | 10 | 10 | 10 | 9 | 2 | 3 | **96/100** |


