# [AUDIT-002][P0] Reject ambiguous NAS source IP attribution in shared UDP syslog

> **Classification:** Security / Security & Data Protection  
> **Difficulty:** Medium · **Effort:** M · **Priority Score:** 88/100  
> **Evidence label:** Verified lookup / inferred cross-tenant effect · **Product scope:** Existing · **Feature contract:** TR-F015 / TR-F033  
> **Baseline:** `bjo163/mwx-isp` `dev`/`main` SHA `1b791f80eed0ead3d679dd890fed56a342d4c104` (2026-10-27)

## Problem Statement
Satu source IP syslog tidak membuktikan tenant bila beberapa NAS memiliki IP yang sama; log berisiko salah dicatat ke tenant pertama.

## Evidence & Current State
`internal/syslogd/server.go:227` memakai global `Where("ipaddr = ?", event.NasIP).First(&nas)` untuk menetapkan TenantID; NetNas.Ipaddr hanya terindeks dan duplikasi IP privat lintas tenant diperbolehkan.

**Important:** Label Verified static berarti source sudah diperiksa, bukan exploit produksi telah diuji. Inferred memerlukan test reproduksi, sedangkan Proposed bukan klaim bug.

## Proposed Solution
Resolver atribusi harus fail-closed bila lookup 0 atau >1 calon; opsi NAT/relay trusted mapping hanya jika punya sumber terpercaya eksplisit.

## Microtasks / Implementation Steps
- [ ] Buat fixture dua tenant dengan IP NAS sama dan injeksi syslog UDP
- [ ] Pecah resolver source NAS agar mendeteksi unique/unknown/ambiguous
- [ ] Buat audit counter untuk setiap keputusan atribusi
- [ ] Uji bahwa tidak ada log tenant A tercatat di tenant B

## Files / Components Scope
- [`internal/syslogd/server.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/syslogd/server.go)
- [`internal/syslogd/server_test.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/syslogd/server_test.go)
- [`internal/domain/network.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/domain/network.go)
- [`docs/tenant-isolation.md`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/docs/tenant-isolation.md)

## Dependencies
Tidak ada hard dependency.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Tanpa pemilik unik, event tidak dipersist ke tenant manapun
- [ ] Sumber unik tetap bekerja
- [ ] Tes dua tenant, unknown, NAT dan DB failure lulus
- [ ] Operator dapat melihat hitungan ambiguous source secara agregat

## Definition of Done
- [ ] Recheck latest `origin/dev` and existing closed issues; attach reproduction or design proof; no duplicate implementation.
- [ ] Relevant Go unit/integration tests with PostgreSQL where concurrency/constraints matter; frontend build/test where affected.
- [ ] Run `golangci-lint run`, `govulncheck` and actionlint when relevant; report executed results, never invent PASS.
- [ ] Verify authorization, tenant isolation, failure paths and backwards compatibility; attach benchmarks/migration notes where applicable.
- [ ] Update `docs/feature-checklist.md` FIRST if scope change is not yet authorized; update roadmap and EN/ID guidance when delivered.
- [ ] Link relevant commits/PR/CI; close only after acceptance is proven. Commits to existing `dev` only, promote reviewed to `main`; NEVER create another branch.

## Risks & Regression Impact
Log pada instalasi NAT multi-tenant mungkin berhenti masuk; perlu dokumentasi topologi dan opsi syslog endpoint per tenant.

## Expected Impact
Integritas bukti insiden antar perusahaan meningkat.

## Prioritization Scores (1–10)
| Impact | Urgency | Alignment | Evidence/Confidence | Feasibility | Complexity | Risk | Weighted Score |
|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 10 | 10 | 10 | 9 | 8 | 4 | 6 | **88/100** |


