# [AUDIT-003][P0] Fix Accounting-Response acceptance semantics under worker overload

> **Classification:** Bug / Bug Fixes & Reliability  
> **Difficulty:** Hard · **Effort:** L · **Priority Score:** 82/100  
> **Evidence label:** Verified static / production-loss risk · **Product scope:** Existing · **Feature contract:** TR-F002 / TR-F022  
> **Baseline:** `bjo163/mwx-isp` `dev`/`main` SHA `1b791f80eed0ead3d679dd890fed56a342d4c104` (2026-10-27)

## Problem Statement
RADIUS NAS bisa menerima ACK sementara accounting task belum diterima, sehingga kuota, sesi online, dan riwayat trafik berpotensi tidak lengkap.

## Evidence & Current State
`internal/radiusd/radius_acct.go:103-133` memanggil `SendResponse` sebelum `submitAcctTask`; `:142-154` menunjukkan enqueue dapat gagal saat pool penuh.

**Important:** Label Verified static berarti source sudah diperiksa, bukan exploit produksi telah diuji. Inferred memerlukan test reproduksi, sedangkan Proposed bukan klaim bug.

## Proposed Solution
Definisikan titik penerimaan accounting yang benar, gunakan bounded admission/durable handoff yang teruji dan idempotensi retransmission; tetap pertahankan backpressure.

## Microtasks / Implementation Steps
- [ ] Tulis regression test fake ResponseWriter + pool saturated yang membuktikan ACK prematur
- [ ] Tentukan kontrak ACK untuk enqueue sukses/gagal serta kegagalan persistence
- [ ] Refactor urutan respons dan task ownership dengan bounded memory
- [ ] Uji duplicate Start/Interim/Stop, restart, load soak dan metrics

## Files / Components Scope
- [`internal/radiusd/radius_acct.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/radiusd/radius_acct.go)
- [`internal/radiusd/radius_acct_overload_test.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/radiusd/radius_acct_overload_test.go)
- [`internal/radiusd/plugins/accounting/`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/radiusd/plugins/accounting/)
- [`test/integration/radius_test.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/test/integration/radius_test.go)

## Dependencies
Tidak ada hard dependency.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Tidak ada Accounting-Response sukses untuk update yang ditolak sebelum handoff
- [ ] Retransmission tidak membuat duplikasi sesi/record
- [ ] Memory bounded dan p95 latency dalam budget yang terukur
- [ ] Semua skenario tenant/NAS dan security checks lulus

## Definition of Done
- [ ] Recheck latest `origin/dev` and existing closed issues; attach reproduction or design proof; no duplicate implementation.
- [ ] Relevant Go unit/integration tests with PostgreSQL where concurrency/constraints matter; frontend build/test where affected.
- [ ] Run `golangci-lint run`, `govulncheck` and actionlint when relevant; report executed results, never invent PASS.
- [ ] Verify authorization, tenant isolation, failure paths and backwards compatibility; attach benchmarks/migration notes where applicable.
- [ ] Update `docs/feature-checklist.md` FIRST if scope change is not yet authorized; update roadmap and EN/ID guidance when delivered.
- [ ] Link relevant commits/PR/CI; close only after acceptance is proven. Commits to existing `dev` only, promote reviewed to `main`; NEVER create another branch.

## Risks & Regression Impact
Mengubah urutan ACK dapat meningkatkan retransmission dan beban; perlu benchmark dan migration path bila menambah durable queue.

## Expected Impact
Keutuhan accounting, FUP, dan billing berbasis pemakaian lebih dapat dipercaya.

## Prioritization Scores (1–10)
| Impact | Urgency | Alignment | Evidence/Confidence | Feasibility | Complexity | Risk | Weighted Score |
|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
