# [AUDIT-004][P1] Block HTTP health-probe redirects outside approved target

> **Classification:** Security / Security & Data Protection  
> **Difficulty:** Medium · **Effort:** S · **Priority Score:** 83/100  
> **Evidence label:** Verified static / exploitability environment-dependent · **Product scope:** Existing · **Feature contract:** TR-F015 / TR-F022  
> **Baseline:** `bjo163/mwx-isp` `dev`/`main` SHA `1b791f80eed0ead3d679dd890fed56a342d4c104` (2026-10-27)

## Problem Statement
Probe ke IP operator-approved dapat me-redirect server ke alamat internal atau metadata lain yang tidak disetujui.

## Evidence & Current State
`internal/adminapi/network_monitor.go:140-160` hanya menerima explicit IP unicast; namun `internal/networkmonitor/monitor.go:299-304` HTTP CheckRedirect membolehkan redirect 5 hop tanpa pemeriksaan alamat tujuan.

**Important:** Label Verified static berarti source sudah diperiksa, bukan exploit produksi telah diuji. Inferred memerlukan test reproduksi, sedangkan Proposed bukan klaim bug.

## Proposed Solution
Tolak redirect off-target secara default atau validasi setiap hop terhadap allowlist target eksplisit; pertahankan audit alasan penolakan.

## Microtasks / Implementation Steps
- [ ] Buat HTTP fake servers untuk same-origin, cross-IP dan metadata redirect
- [ ] Terapkan CheckRedirect yang fail-closed terhadap target baru
- [ ] Batasi timeout, response body, DNS/transport policy
- [ ] Dokumen cara mendaftarkan target tambahan bila memang diperlukan

## Files / Components Scope
- [`internal/networkmonitor/monitor.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/networkmonitor/monitor.go)
- [`internal/networkmonitor/monitor_test.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/networkmonitor/monitor_test.go)
- [`internal/adminapi/network_monitor.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/adminapi/network_monitor.go)

## Dependencies
Tidak ada hard dependency.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Cross-destination redirect ditolak jelas
- [ ] Probe normal IP approved tetap berhasil
- [ ] HTTP response data sensitif tidak dicatat
- [ ] Tests IPV4/IPV6, scheme downgrade dan redirect-loop lulus

## Definition of Done
- [ ] Recheck latest `origin/dev` and existing closed issues; attach reproduction or design proof; no duplicate implementation.
- [ ] Relevant Go unit/integration tests with PostgreSQL where concurrency/constraints matter; frontend build/test where affected.
- [ ] Run `golangci-lint run`, `govulncheck` and actionlint when relevant; report executed results, never invent PASS.
- [ ] Verify authorization, tenant isolation, failure paths and backwards compatibility; attach benchmarks/migration notes where applicable.
- [ ] Update `docs/feature-checklist.md` FIRST if scope change is not yet authorized; update roadmap and EN/ID guidance when delivered.
- [ ] Link relevant commits/PR/CI; close only after acceptance is proven. Commits to existing `dev` only, promote reviewed to `main`; NEVER create another branch.

## Risks & Regression Impact
Beberapa perangkat memakai redirect login/HTTPS; perlu eksplisit opt-in atau konfigurasi target HTTPS terpisah.

## Expected Impact
Mengurangi risiko SSRF dan memperjelas arti health-check.

