# [AUDIT-030][P2] Introduce additive versioned schema-migration verification and release compatibility gates

> **Classification:** Refactor / Architecture & Code Quality  
> **Difficulty:** Hard · **Effort:** L · **Priority Score:** 59/100  
> **Evidence label:** Verified forward-only limits · **Product scope:** Existing · **Feature contract:** TR-F020 / TR-F022  
> **Baseline:** `bjo163/mwx-isp` `dev`/`main` SHA `1b791f80eed0ead3d679dd890fed56a342d4c104` (2026-10-27)

## Problem Statement
Kegagalan upgrade produksi dapat memerlukan restore data-volume penuh untuk rollback.

## Evidence & Current State
`docs/backup-restore-drill-2026-10-27.md` menyatakan AutoMigrate forward-only tanpa down migrations dan binary lama tidak dijamin cocok setelah upgrade.

**Important:** Label Verified static berarti source sudah diperiksa, bukan exploit produksi telah diuji. Inferred memerlukan test reproduksi, sedangkan Proposed bukan klaim bug.

## Proposed Solution
Sediakan migration ledger/preflight, backwards-compatible expand/contract discipline, compatibility test binary N-1 pada snapshot sanitized; jangan menerapkan destructive migrations otomatis.

## Microtasks / Implementation Steps
- [ ] Inventaris perubahan DDL dan schema startup saat ini
- [ ] Definisikan versi schema + lock migrasi dan preflight mismatch
- [ ] Tambah migrasi additive pertama dan test upgrade/idempotence
- [ ] Uji rolling upgrade/rollback N-1 pada isolated PostgreSQL

## Files / Components Scope
- [`internal/app/app.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/app/app.go)
- [`internal/app/database.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/app/database.go)
- [`internal/app/initdb.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/internal/app/initdb.go)
- [`scripts/vps-update.sh`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/scripts/vps-update.sh)
- [`test/integration/migration_test.go`](https://github.com/bjo163/mwx-isp/blob/dev/test/integration/migration_test.go)

## Dependencies
Tidak ada hard dependency.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Upgrade additive idempotent dan punya preflight
- [ ] Tidak ada DDL destruktif terselubung
- [ ] Binary/version compatibility failure menolak upgrade sebelum mutasi
- [ ] Restore compatibility terdokumentasi

## Definition of Done
- [ ] Recheck latest `origin/dev` and existing closed issues; attach reproduction or design proof; no duplicate implementation.
- [ ] Relevant Go unit/integration tests with PostgreSQL where concurrency/constraints matter; frontend build/test where affected.
- [ ] Run `golangci-lint run`, `govulncheck` and actionlint when relevant; report executed results, never invent PASS.
- [ ] Verify authorization, tenant isolation, failure paths and backwards compatibility; attach benchmarks/migration notes where applicable.
- [ ] Update `docs/feature-checklist.md` FIRST if scope change is not yet authorized; update roadmap and EN/ID guidance when delivered.
- [ ] Link relevant commits/PR/CI; close only after acceptance is proven. Commits to existing `dev` only, promote reviewed to `main`; NEVER create another branch.

